From 23950a3a60d255ca0812ce4a3f2083d0252240c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 09:32:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mint a fresh GitHub token immediately before each GitHub
 action.

Dispatch-time installation tokens expire in ~1h while Profiler can run
45 minutes. Stop treating the Console-supplied token as the primary cache:
mint via App JWT (or Console POST /api/orchestrator/github-token) at role
start and again before the post-run issue snapshot, and retry once on 401.
